    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Can you go a bit deeper into the specific chemical mechanisms? Like, why does the manganese become specifically problematic as we move toward that higher 7.0 threshold compared to the iron? I want to explain the oxidation states and precipitation processes clearly in the report.",
